OL,3,GNEWSACity mayor role scrapped in
OL,4,Aunanimous vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe role of elected mayor in Leicester
OL,7,Fwill be abolished in 2027, it has been
OL,8,Fconfirmed.
OL,10,FThe major change to Leicester City
OL,11,FCouncil's political structure was
OL,12,Fapproved in a unanimous vote by
OL,13,Fcouncillors on Thursday night.
OL,15,FFrom May 2027, the authority will
OL,16,Frevert to a leader and cabinet model of
OL,17,Fdecision-making, ending the current
OL,18,Fmayoral system which was introduced in
OL,19,F2011.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
