OL,3,GNEWSACity mayor role scrapped in
OL,4,Aunanimous vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe current mayor, Labour's Sir Peter
OL,7,FSoulsby, told councillors moving to a
OL,8,Fnew way of running the authority was
OL,9,F"inevitable".
